# Task Manager — Architecture & Flow Diagram

## High-Level Architecture

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Frontend["⚛️ React Frontend (Vite)"]
        App["App.jsx — Main Orchestrator"]
        API["api.js — API Service Layer"]
        
        subgraph Components["UI Components"]
            AddTask["AddTaskForm"]
            TaskCard["TaskCard"]
            CatTabs["CategoryTabs"]
            CatModal["CategoryModal"]
            CompleteModal["CompleteTaskModal"]
            Reminder["ReminderBanner"]
            Insights["InsightsPanel"]
            Progress["ProgressPanel"]
            SidePanel["SidePanel"]
            StarCounter["StarCounter"]
            StarBurst["StarBurst"]
            StarHistory["StarHistory"]
        end
    end

    subgraph Backend["🐍 Flask Backend (app.py)"]
        Flask["Flask Server :5000"]
        Learner["learner.py — ML Prediction Engine"]
    end

    subgraph DB["🍃 MongoDB"]
        Tasks[(tasks)]
        Categories[(categories)]
        Stars[(star_log)]
        Notes[(task_notes)]
        Lifetime[(lifetime_tracking)]
    end

    App --> API
    Components --> App
    API -- "HTTP REST" --> Flask
    Flask --> DB
    Flask --> Learner
    Learner --> DB
```

---

## Data Flow — Creating a Task

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant Form as AddTaskForm
    participant App as App.jsx
    participant API as api.js
    participant Flask as Flask Server
    participant ML as learner.py
    participant DB as MongoDB

    U->>Form: Fill title, time, category
    Form->>API: predict(title)
    API->>Flask: GET /api/predict?title=...
    Flask->>ML: predict_category() + predict_time()
    ML->>DB: Query completed tasks
    DB-->>ML: Historical data
    ML-->>Flask: {category, confidence, estimated_minutes}
    Flask-->>API: Prediction result
    API-->>Form: Auto-suggest category & time

    U->>Form: Submit task
    Form->>App: handleAddTask(taskData)
    App->>API: createTask(data)
    API->>Flask: POST /api/tasks
    Flask->>DB: Insert new task
    DB-->>Flask: ✅ Created
    Flask-->>API: New task object
    API-->>App: Success
    App->>App: Refresh task list
```

---

## Data Flow — Completing a Task & Earning Stars

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 👤 User
    participant TC as TaskCard
    participant App as App.jsx
    participant API as api.js
    participant Flask as Flask Server
    participant DB as MongoDB

    TC->>TC: Countdown timer running ⏳
    TC-->>App: handleCountdownComplete(task)
    App->>App: openCompleteModal(task)
    U->>App: Enter actual time
    App->>API: updateTask(id, {done: true, actual_time})
    API->>Flask: PUT /api/tasks/:id
    Flask->>DB: Update task → done
    Flask-->>API: ✅ Updated

    App->>API: earnStars(taskId)
    API->>Flask: POST /api/stars/earn
    Flask->>DB: Calculate stars (1 star/hr)
    Flask->>DB: Insert star_log entry
    Flask-->>API: {stars_earned, total_today}
    API-->>App: Star count
    App->>App: StarBurst animation 🌟
    App->>App: Update StarCounter
```

---

## Component Interaction Map

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph Core["Core Flow"]
        AddTask["➕ AddTaskForm"] -->|creates| App["🧠 App.jsx"]
        App -->|renders| TaskCard["📋 TaskCard"]
        TaskCard -->|complete| CompleteModal["✅ CompleteTaskModal"]
        CompleteModal -->|stars| StarBurst["💫 StarBurst"]
    end

    subgraph Filtering["Filtering"]
        CatTabs["🏷️ CategoryTabs"] -->|filter| App
        CatModal["📁 CategoryModal"] -->|add/delete| App
    end

    subgraph Sidebar["Right Sidebar (SidePanel)"]
        SidePanel["📊 SidePanel"]
        SidePanel --> Insights["💡 InsightsPanel"]
        SidePanel --> Progress["📈 ProgressPanel"]
        SidePanel --> StarHistory["⭐ StarHistory"]
    end

    subgraph TopBar["Top Bar"]
        StarCounter["🏆 StarCounter"]
        Reminder["🔔 ReminderBanner"]
    end

    App --> SidePanel
    App --> StarCounter
    App --> Reminder
```

