## API Routes Map

| Method | Route | Purpose | Component |
|--------|-------|---------|-----------|
| **GET** | `/api/tasks` | Fetch all tasks | App |
| **POST** | `/api/tasks` | Create task | AddTaskForm |
| **PUT** | `/api/tasks/:id` | Update/complete task | TaskCard |
| **DELETE** | `/api/tasks/:id` | Delete task | TaskCard |
| **GET** | `/api/categories` | List categories | CategoryTabs |
| **POST** | `/api/categories` | Create category | CategoryModal |
| **DELETE** | `/api/categories/:id` | Delete category | CategoryModal |
| **GET** | `/api/predict` | ML predictions | AddTaskForm |
| **GET** | `/api/reminders` | Upcoming deadlines | ReminderBanner |
| **GET** | `/api/insights` | Daily patterns | InsightsPanel |
| **POST** | `/api/stars/earn` | Award stars | App |
| **GET** | `/api/stars/today` | Today's star count | StarCounter |
| **GET** | `/api/stars/week` | Weekly star history | StarHistory |
| **GET** | `/api/progress` | Time tracking chart | ProgressPanel |
| **GET/POST** | `/api/task-notes/:key` | Per-task notes | TaskCard |
| **GET** | `/api/task-names/search` | Autocomplete | AddTaskForm |
| **POST** | `/api/lifetime-track` | Mark lifetime-tracked | SidePanel |
| **GET** | `/api/lifetime-tracking` | Lifetime totals | SidePanel |

---

## ML Prediction Engine ([learner.py](file:///e:/Ai_handler/learner.py))

```mermaid
graph TD
    Title["Task Title Input"] --> Tokenize["tokenize() — Remove stop words"]
    Tokenize --> CatPredict["predict_category()"]
    Tokenize --> TimePredict["predict_time()"]

    CatPredict --> Direct["1. Direct Match — Title word = Category name?"]
    CatPredict --> TFIDF["2. TF-IDF Scoring — Keyword frequency from history"]
    Direct --> Result["Best category + confidence + alternatives"]
    TFIDF --> Result

    TimePredict --> Median["Weighted median of actual durations from similar tasks"]
    Median --> TimeResult["Estimated minutes + data points"]

    subgraph Insights["get_daily_insights()"]
        Patterns["Analyze time-of-day & day-of-week patterns"]
        Suggestions["Generate scheduling suggestions"]
    end
```
